; Orbit (issue #373, a large Hot Potato stage for five to eight players):
; two floors facing each other across a 960 px void, and the only way across is
; the orbit: two platforms circling the void on a rectangular track (#279's
; loop_points), half a lap apart, so there is always one coming. A perch above
; each floor's outer end, reached from a bounce pad, is the way to watch the
; orbit and drop on a rider from above. The chase is a ring of its own: floor ->
; orbit -> far floor -> orbit -> back, with the perches as the way round.
; 
; Large: the view is 2240 x 1260 (Stage.view_size). Terrain spans x = -1100..1100.
; Rotation: weighted 4x for Hot Potato (Stage.mode_weights).
[node name="Orbit" type="Node2D"]
script = ExtResource("script")
background_sky_top = Color(0.1, 0.1, 0.18, 1)
background_sky_bottom = Color(0.24, 0.2, 0.3, 1)
background_silhouette = Color(0.09, 0.08, 0.14, 1)
background_layers = PackedStringArray("clouds", "mountains", "clouds")
view_size = Vector2(2240, 1260)
mode_weights = {"hot_potato": 4.0}

